	(descr "Degson DG135T-10.16-02P-14-00A(H) screw terminal, 2 poles, 10.16 mm, 57 A IEC / 52 A UL, 4-10 mm2. Drawing DG135T-10.16-XXP-1Y-00A(H): 2 pins per pole, rows 10.16 apart, hole 2.40. Front row (y=0) = wire entry side; the wire-entry bump (y +2.2..+6.3, 4.5-17.5 mm above the board) may overhang the board edge. Verify hole spacing on a sample (STEP shows 9.66). Pads numbered from the far end so pad 1 is on +x.")
